# AILPG — Teacher Dashboard UI/UX Specification

**Project:** AI Learning Platform Generator (AILPG)
**Document:** Teacher Dashboard UI/UX Specification
**Layer:** UI/UX Blueprint
**Document ID:** AILPG-UIUX-05
**Status:** Draft / Implementation Ready
**Audience:** Product, UI/UX, Flutter/Web Developers, Backend Developers, QA, AI/ML Engineers

---

## 1. Purpose

The Teacher Dashboard is the primary workspace for educators using AILPG to convert solved-problem videos into interactive learning lessons.

The dashboard must support the complete teacher workflow:

```text
Teacher Login
      ↓
Dashboard
      ↓
Course
      ↓
Lesson
      ↓
Upload MP4
      ↓
Configure AI
      ↓
Process
      ↓
Review AI Output
      ↓
Edit / Approve
      ↓
Preview
      ↓
Publish
      ↓
Monitor Student Results
```

The teacher should not need to manually create every lesson component from scratch.

AILPG should automate content generation while keeping the teacher in control of the final published lesson.

---

# 2. Teacher Dashboard Goals

The dashboard must allow teachers to:

* Create and manage courses
* Create modules
* Create lessons
* Upload MP4 videos
* Validate uploaded videos
* Configure AI processing
* Monitor processing status
* Review transcripts
* Review extracted concepts
* Review generated questions
* Edit questions
* Move question checkpoints
* Review translations
* Edit lesson metadata
* Preview the interactive lesson
* Publish or unpublish lessons
* Monitor student performance
* View lesson analytics
* View course analytics
* Manage teacher settings
* Receive processing notifications

